WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The film never changed.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The question did: "hit" or "smashed"?

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Sixteen of fifty in the smashed group reported glass. Seven of fifty in the hit group did.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
But there was no broken glass in the film.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:33.000
A report is measurable. A rewritten memory is harder to prove.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Question the claim. Read the study. Audio-product benefits need their own proof.
